                                "sense_id": "cedabe13-8f59-35eb-9e0a-c1d5699c505f",
                                "text": "The containers were shipped from the eastern Chinese port of Ningbo to Piraeus by sea, and were then transported to Budapest in two trains that reached on Jan. 29 and Feb. 5, according to China's official People's Daily newspaper."
