                                "sense_id": "cedabe13-8f59-35eb-9e0a-c1d5699c505f",
                                "text": "Congestion off China's top two container ports Shanghai and Ningbo is worsening following the shutdown of a container terminal in Ningbo where a COVID-19 case was detected this week."
                            }
                        ]
